ved  and pulled his body out from the flames  that way only his bone remained which  would make everyone else think that the  rest of his body was incinerated  the next scene shows us an even younger  version of toya  and this panel was really interesting  because he actually has a smile on his  face  during training at this point his hair  is red but endeavour notices that some  part of his hair  is actually starting to turn white toya  tells his dad not to worry about this  and arcs endeavor to teach him his  ultimate move which of course is  prominence burn  in the next panel we see endeavour with  a smile on his face  which shows that you know endeavor and  toyah did actually have  some kind of good relationship at one  point because endeavour mentioned the  colour of toya's hair  it is now officially a real plot point  so the anime has no choice but to make  dabbi's hair white  when we get this reveal previously the  two times we've seen  toya's hair in the anime his hair has  been red whereas in the manga it has  consistently been white  even in the scene which was shown in the  anime in the chapter last week  we got our first indication that toya's  hair changed color  during this panel and this probably  happened due to stress of all the  training  or maybe raised jeans were starting to  kick in  let me know which one you think it was  down below but yeah either way the fact  is  toyo was born with red hair but it  turned white after a while  the narration continues and it describes  toya as someone with stronger firepower  than his father  but lacking the icy power to neutralize  his overheating  ray suggested to endeavour that she  should have more children so that the  siblings could support each other  which resulted in fiumi being born  however fiumi only possessed the ice  quark  while endeavour wished for a child with  a half-hot half-cold quirk  he wasn't angry at this time because  toya still had more talent than he did  and he believed that if he poured all  his energy into this child  then toyo would fulfill his ambitions  the chapter then moves back to the  present day  and we see debbie still standing on  giganto making his back  while shoto and endeavour are just  looking up at him according to the fan  translations  endeavour doesn't believe what toya said  but then the eldest todoroki son  mentions how he did a dna test  using blood he got from endeavour during  the pro hero arc  the dna test proved that there was a  99.9  match between derby and endeavour and in  fact this test was shown as part of the  broadcast  that dabby was sending to the whole of  japan we see that natsu witnesses this  broadcast on his phone  and understandably his face is in  complete shock  meanwhile fumi is teaching a class of  students  but is interrupted when someone burst  into the classroom to tell her the news  in the middle of a random city in japan  we can see that david's broadcast is  even on the big public screens so it  just shows you that literally everyone  is seeing this  toya asks the public if someone like  endeavour is worthy of the title of  number one hero  when he has such a dark past and when  he's a person who only ever thinks about  himself  the scene moves over to endeavour's  biggest fan who is the kid from the pro  hero arc  at first he didn't want to believe the  broadcast but then we see him start to  scream  as darby continues to reveal more  information about the heroes  at this point he's now moving on from  talking about endeavour  to talking about hawks and dabi  broadcasts the moment  in which horse kills twice to the entire  country  i think it's important to remember that  hawks had his feathers completely bugged  with all these different cameras  and so skeptic probably just acquired  the footage of hawks killing twice  by just checking the recent recordings  from one of his feathers  dabby begins to rub it in by saying that  not only did hawks kill  twice he also killed best genus and as  if that wasn't enough  toya then continues and reveals that  hawks's father  was a villain which is something i've  suspected for a long time  back in the endeavor agency arc it was  mentioned how endeavour once captured a  thief named takami  and as we all know you know hawke's last  name is also takami according to darby  hawks's father was a serial killer and a  thief before endeavour captured him  which is possibly the reason why hawkes  idolizes endeavors so much  now if we just take a step backwards  dabi has exposed the top two heroes  at a time when faith in heroes is  already you know it's already on the  decline  i mean we had the incident during the  pro hero arc and then we had deku city  during the maven academia arc  and then i mean in in the present day we  have gigantomachia  destroying countless cities so faith was  already shaken  so the fact that he's now exposing the  top two guys  yeah it's not a good time for the heroes  back on the battlefield  endeavour is just too shocked to even  move a muscle  and shoto screams at him that you know  he needs to move we see that shoto has  tears in his eyes  as he yells an endeavor to protect  midoriya and the others  while he and neduri will deal with derby  during the last few chapters  shoto and neduri have definitely become  a dream team that i just never  imagined would happen toya then jumps  off giganto machia  and despite his frail body he begins to  activate the prominence burn attack  this is of course the ultimate move  which he asked endeavour to teach him  during the flashback  um but honestly we've never seen a  prominent sperm with blue flames before  so it's possible this is the strongest  version of the attack that there has  ever been  as dabby approaches he thanks endeavour  for being fine up until today  but as he gets closer we see some steel  wires begin to smash into the ground  as even gigantomachia begins to fall  over  these steel wires are the work of best  genus  who literally jumps out of the jet he  was in alongside the uh the wires  themselves  the chapter ends with genus saying that  he is returning to hero work  starting today and i'm sure debbie will  be super pissed to see that genus is  actually still alive  i guess he has no choice but to kill  best genius in the next few chapters  to uh to make himself not look like a  liar and yeah guys those were the  spoilers for chapter 291  as usual let me know what you think in  the comments down below and don't forget  to check out the live reaction to the  official chapter  on sunday next week there won't be a new  chapter  as harakoshi is taking a break but there  will still be other videos on this  channel obviously  so be sure to have your notifications on  and you know hit that sub button if you  haven't already  until the next one peace out
 

